      <description>&lt;p&gt;The last &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.acfe.com/rttn-summary.aspx&#34;&gt;Report to the Nation published by ACFE&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, stated that on average, &lt;strong&gt;fraud&lt;/strong&gt; accounts for nearly the &lt;strong&gt;5% of companies revenues&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;on average, fraud accounts for nearly the 5% of companies revenues&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://ctt.ec/q3j4X&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://clicktotweet.com/img/tweet-graphic-4.png&#34; alt=&#34;Tweet: on average, fraud accounts for nearly the 5% of companies revenues. http://ctt.ec/u5E6x+&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.acfe.com/rttn/images/cost-of-fraud-infographic.pdf&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://andreacirilloblog.files.wordpress.com/2015/07/2015-07-01-14_00_34-www-acfe-com_rttn_images_cost-of-fraud-infographic-pdf.png&#34; alt=&#34;ACFE Infographic: typical organization loses 5% of their revenues for fraud&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Projecting this number for the whole world GDP, it results that the &amp;ldquo;&lt;strong&gt;fraud&lt;/strong&gt;-country&amp;rdquo; produces something like a &lt;strong&gt;GDP 3 times greater than the Canadian GDP&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
